b5c9c8b2-8b17-4b14-96de-7cb6d2dceea0	5d593eb7-b3c4-4600-aefa-56c14415c194	\N	https://huggingface.co/blog/continuous_batching	Continuous batching from first principles	https://huggingface.co/blog/continuous_batching	https://huggingface.co/blog/continuous_batching	\N	\N	\N	tutorial	en	2025-11-25 00:00:00+00	2026-11-09 17:12:36.510917+00	3	\N	3e3dd50d0c080cdcc587b47f71b93309915b787dc577ccb4dbbeedbf19772885	processed	2026-11-09 17:12:36.511531+00	2026-11-10 13:36:49.46606+00	pending	\N	\N	pending	0	\N	\N
