f1616e1b-9af3-4723-aaaa-dd9061e5a0ae	928ad6da-fec1-474b-ae1a-3cf781cb4d3e	\N	oai:arXiv.org:2609.20159v2	Special Lagrangian cones in Deep Learning	https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.20159	https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.20159	Tejas Kotwal, Govind Menon	arXiv:2609.20159v2 Announce Type: replace-cross \nAbstract: We introduce a matrix generalization of the cone of Harvey and Lawson and prove that it is an exact special Lagrangian manifold. We further show that it belongs to a family of exact special Lagrangian manifolds that foliate the balanced manifold arising in deep learning.	arXiv:2609.20159v2 Announce Type: replace-cross \nAbstract: We introduce a matrix generalization of the cone of Harvey and Lawson and prove that it is an exact special Lagrangian manifold. We further show that it belongs to a family of exact special Lagrangian manifolds that foliate the balanced manifold arising in deep learning.	research	en	2026-11-10 05:00:00+00	2026-11-10 16:30:03.932689+00	3	\N	b6a7e25943e216a69601769f64a954922d986b702830d20439cca6746ed0a384	processed	2026-11-10 16:30:03.933013+00	2026-11-10 16:36:07.301998+00	pending	\N	\N	pending	0	\N	\N
