f45d4c61-5ed2-4886-befe-bff9252b0063	110c8b74-5d9a-4479-9380-aab19486cc0c	\N	https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-3-8-live-and-3-8-live-extended-thinking/	Introducing Gemini 3.8 Live and 3.8 Live Extended Thinking	https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-3-8-live-and-3-8-live-extended-thinking/	https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-3-8-live-and-3-8-live-extended-thinking/	\N	\N	\N	product_update	en	2026-09-15 17:05:57+00	2026-11-09 17:12:35.143351+00	4	\N	06d32397db46f936d3287082a87457720b72b0143a56ebd4e96ecc24c0aa0e24	processed	2026-11-09 17:12:35.143882+00	2026-11-10 13:25:18.476738+00	pending	\N	\N	pending	0	\N	\N
