80116b9a-3a62-49c8-9688-6660aefbbc5f	5d593eb7-b3c4-4600-aefa-56c14415c194	\N	https://huggingface.co/blog/nxp/bringing-robotics-ai-to-embedded-platforms	Bringing Robotics AI to Embedded Platforms: Dataset Recording, VLA Fine‑Tuning, and On‑Device Optimizations	https://huggingface.co/blog/nxp/bringing-robotics-ai-to-embedded-platforms	https://huggingface.co/blog/nxp/bringing-robotics-ai-to-embedded-platforms	\N	\N	\N	product_update	en	2026-03-05 14:16:49+00	2026-11-09 17:12:36.405753+00	3	\N	c053a19c2542781cd0984945f4492b828eebe631f695e604fda041ccdc03c016	processed	2026-11-09 17:12:36.406668+00	2026-11-10 13:35:13.506591+00	pending	\N	\N	pending	0	\N	\N
